This reads into `ibuf`. But `ibuf` was allocated with `ibuf.alloc(blocksize + OVERHEAD)` in `unpack()`. So `ibuf` is valid.

But wait - `un_shlib_1` calls `unpackExtent(sz_elf_hdrs, nullptr, ...)` which decompresses into `ibuf`. Then `memcpy(o_elfhdrs, ibuf, sz_elf_hdrs)`.

